Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.51,0:00:10.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How many tasks was assigned to Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:11.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Three\N
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.58,0:00:13.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do you need to complete them?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.58,0:00:15.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After they are compelted, I'll become an executor!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.54,0:00:17.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll be qualified to become master's sidekick!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:19.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh......
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.55,0:00:20.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is an executor?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.90,0:00:22.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are law enforcers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.74,0:00:24.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, isn't that dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:27.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm, that's why they go through tasks and examinations
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.26,0:00:30.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,isn't that the 2nd task too easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.26,0:00:33.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe ti's for Xiaohei to get in close contact with humans
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:35.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and learn to manage all kinds of situations
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.90,0:00:37.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ohhh~~
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.34,0:00:41.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The time's up, we can open task 3
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.54,0:00:47.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's writte on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.06,0:00:52.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Earn the compliments of the elfin-king Folan, complete before New Year's Eve
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.50,0:00:55.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah...... that's a lot of months
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.54,0:00:58.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Folan......I've never heard of them......
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.82,0:01:01.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means we will have to find someone named Folan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.94,0:01:03.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and make him compliment you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.34,0:01:05.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eh......that's a rather strange task
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.94,0:01:08.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe they are in need of our help
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.10,0:01:12.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Elfin King......Folan......
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.66,0:01:14.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are the ones with that title?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.06,0:01:16.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Elfin King is a title among the elfin realm
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.38,0:01:19.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Most famous among them, are probably Wukong and Nezha
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.62,0:01:21.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's due to them being included in many novels
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.26,0:01:23.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ohhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.50,0:01:24.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nezha is an Elfin King?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.94,0:01:26.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, do you recognize him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.74,0:01:27.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.46,0:01:27.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa!!~
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.70,0:01:30.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then what's the difference between an Elfin King and a god?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.90,0:01:33.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Elfin King usually refers to an elfin who have conquered a territory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.62,0:01:35.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No one's been given that title in a long time
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.18,0:01:37.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So that's why master never mentioned it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.62,0:01:40.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and Nezha have already been bestowed the title of god
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.26,0:01:42.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that's why it's never mentioned he's oncce an Elfin King
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.38,0:01:46.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does that mean, maybe FOlan isn't an Elfin King anymore either
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.06,0:01:49.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm, maybe we'll have to llok around for clues
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.70,0:01:51.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No results online either
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.02,0:01:52.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll ask around on elfin forums
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.86,0:01:55.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The deadline is New Year's Eve, we have quite a bit of time
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.86,0:01:58.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's wait for more info, look around tomorrow morning
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.18,0:02:00.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm, alright
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.62,0:02:09.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh......
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.19,0:02:12.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No one seems to know......
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.90,0:02:13.74,Text A,,0,0,0,,{\pos(578,334)}Who's even called that nowadays?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.90,0:02:13.74,Text A,,0,0,0,,{\pos(578,576)}I can tell you very responsibly, no one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.90,0:02:13.74,Text A,,0,0,0,,{\pos(578,802)}I know all the 87 recorded Elfin Kings in history,{\c&F4F8F7&}--------{\c} \N none of them are named Folan
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.86,0:02:16.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll leave the thread up, I'll look around for a bit
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.14,0:02:18.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we ask someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.54,0:02:21.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,those who know stuff like this, are probably older folks
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.30,0:02:22.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Laojun must know!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.62,0:02:24.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Em......
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.38,0:02:28.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.94,0:02:29.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,no reason to bother him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.66,0:02:30.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh~~
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.18,0:02:37.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Boring, none of the new shows are any good~ Why's no one visiting me~~
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.34,0:02:38.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Diting~~Diting~~Diting~
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.82,0:02:40.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hush, I'm reading
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.42,0:02:41.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.94,0:02:50.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Elfin King Folan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.06,0:02:53.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, never heard of it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.06,0:02:56.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Old men like me have seen many things
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.70,0:02:58.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I really have never heard of someone with tha name
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.34,0:03:02.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For Elfin Kings are quite different from hidden saints
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.74,0:03:07.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Most of them are given that title for their famed and renowned power
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.54,0:03:12.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why I think there doesn't exist such a formidible force within the mainland
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.62,0:03:16.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What you're saying is, he might be an elfin King that lived elsewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.42,0:03:21.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, but I can assure you we've never had one with that name
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.78,0:03:23.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm, alright, thank you kindly master
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.30,0:03:29.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How as it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.50,0:03:31.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Said there's no one named that in mainland
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.62,0:03:33.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe this is a task for abrod?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.06,0:03:35.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are elfin abroad as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.58,0:03:36.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haha, of course
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.74,0:03:40.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As long it's a place creatures exists, elfins exist
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.54,0:03:43.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why every nation have its own myths and legends
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.74,0:03:46.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then are they all among the crowd now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.86,0:03:51.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm, most of the elfins here abide by the law
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.26,0:03:53.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about elsewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.22,0:03:56.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Currently coexistence is mainstream
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.42,0:03:58.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But there are also nations ruled by elfins
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.98,0:04:01.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They often only seek representatives among humans
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.66,0:04:03.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,citizens also treat them as their faith
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.14,0:04:06.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Most of the other nations have treated them as fiction,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.06,0:04:08.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to lessen their impact
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.74,0:04:10.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Humans now are committed to technology
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.90,0:04:12.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and walks on a different path from Elfins
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.30,0:04:14.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which path is the correct one?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.14,0:04:16.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no absolute right answer
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.86,0:04:18.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Humans, Elfins
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.98,0:04:20.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,compared to the world, is minuscule
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.70,0:04:23.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They both have their limitations, and too many variables
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.06,0:04:25.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oooh~
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.66,0:04:26.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do we do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.30,0:04:28.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it against the rules to ask the guild?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.54,0:04:30.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.14,0:04:32.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are you asking......
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.06,0:04:33.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why don't we ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.34,0:04:33.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh......
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.02,0:04:37.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shanxin's call
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.38,0:04:39.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's up? Is everything tidied up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.54,0:04:41.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you're finished I'll come visit you guys~~
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.82,0:04:43.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Apologies Shanxin
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.26,0:04:45.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We might be away for a long while
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.22,0:04:48.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're on our way to complete a big mission
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.14,0:04:49.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.18,0:04:53.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I say it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.74,0:04:54.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.30,0:04:56.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you asking me......
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.02,0:05:00.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We might be out of the country, to look for an elfin
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.62,0:05:02.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh? To which country?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.54,0:05:04.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not sure, we don't know where he's at
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.30,0:05:06.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why we are researching
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.38,0:05:08.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oooh
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.86,0:05:11.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's an Elfin King named Folan, do you know who he is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.58,0:05:12.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How oculd Shanxin possibly know
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.42,0:05:12.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Folan...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.70,0:05:15.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it a compliment from the Elfin King Folan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.10,0:05:17.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,HOW DO YOU KNOW?????
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.38,0:05:21.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A game mission is the All Linving Creatures???
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.46,0:05:24.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this morning the game posted about 100 missions
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.94,0:05:26.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone's talking about it
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.22,0:05:28.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why didn't I find any search results from before?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.54,0:05:30.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This mission was updated 10 minutes ago
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.82,0:05:32.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just found out as well
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.34,0:05:34.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a lot of replies from the thread now too......
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.98,0:05:39.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So Xiaohei's 3rd mission......
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.06,0:05:41.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is an......In-Game Mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.98,0:05:43.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That simple?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.86,0:05:45.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Simple? Wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.10,0:05:49.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is an impossible mission!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.22,0:05:50.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Haaah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.84,0:06:28.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This means your final task is completing a video game?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.48,0:06:28.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.56,0:06:31.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So what exactly is this mission about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.76,0:06:33.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Earlier today the game published about 100 new missions
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.52,0:06:37.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Elfin King Folan's Compliments" is the last one posted
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.59,0:06:41.92,Text B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(468,400)} Human players that have reached level 200\N[No Red Names]{\c&FEFEFE&}----------------
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.59,0:06:39.75,Text B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(478,562)}Hunt red name players from lv 60-200,{\c&FEFEFE&}-----------{\c}\N every level with 2 claims
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.75,0:06:41.92,Text B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(472,570)}Hunt red name players from lv 60-200{\c}\N every level with 2 claims
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.59,0:06:41.92,Text B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(470,722)}Complete all high level side quests
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.59,0:06:41.92,Text B,,0,0,0,,{\pos(474,868)}Acquire all artifacts{\c&FEFEFE&}------
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.82,0:06:39.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and the hardest mission here
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.75,0:06:41.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This seems liek a list of things by itself......
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.05,0:06:45.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Completing this mission seems like one of the highest accomplishment within the game
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.04,0:06:47.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There may not be a set limit to how players can complete it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.04,0:06:51.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but due its difficulty, I imagine there won't be many who can complete it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.44,0:06:56.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seems like...collecting the artifacts is the easiest part?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.36,0:06:57.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.04,0:07:00.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Althought there are already player who've gotten artifacts,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.88,0:07:04.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but accordingto what's recorded online, there are only 11 types discovered thus far
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.36,0:07:06.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are 2 types left to be discovered
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.48,0:07:10.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means, over a couple 10s of millions of player have yet to complete a set of these artifacts
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.44,0:07:14.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, thinks like artifacts will only become more common as time goes on
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.88,0:07:17.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's gotta be those who obtained them but didn't wanna share it online
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.28,0:07:21.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I figure after a couple days there will be detailed descriptions of all artifacts
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.08,0:07:24.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So ar it seems, the hardest, is the first requirement
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.36,0:07:27.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't there players who are already level 50?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.40,0:07:29.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,there's already those over level 100......
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.44,0:07:34.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since the game is quite special, there's been high level players since the server opened
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.76,0:07:38.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So far out the players who are over level 60, Human players make up 12% of them
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.76,0:07:40.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but they are all red-named
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.96,0:07:42.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not a single one without a red name
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.88,0:07:45.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Others are all players of animals or mystical creatures
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.16,0:07:47.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mystical creatures starts with high base stats
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.04,0:07:52.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People online have found that a lvl 1 mystical creature is the equivalent to a level 20-30 human
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.04,0:07:55.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So currently most of the high level players high level players are mystical creatures
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.40,0:07:56.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So currently most of the high level players are mystical creatures
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.40,0:07:59.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but everyone seems to think human players will scale into stronger creatures later on
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.80,0:08:01.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In short, reaching lvl 200 in itself is very difficult
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.36,0:08:04.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and you also can't be red-named, which is even more difficult
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.92,0:08:06.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Which part do you not understant, Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.08,0:08:10.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everything......what's "astonishing" (Experience)...what's......
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.40,0:08:12.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah that, let me explain
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.60,0:08:16.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ooooooh
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.96,0:08:18.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.72,0:08:19.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it's a normal game,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.96,0:08:22.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,spending some time will ensure you reaching high levels
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.80,0:08:25.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But in this game, if your character dies, they are gone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.56,0:08:29.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So to weaker players, it's possible to be level 1 forever
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.56,0:08:32.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The hard part about this mission is that you cannot die before its completion
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.16,0:08:35.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:39.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These missions, maybe they are what executors must accomplish
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.28,0:08:43.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, is this the test of master Wuxian?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.80,0:08:47.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but you can only accept the mission once, can't do it again after you die
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.56,0:08:50.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,right, once ap erson dies of course the task is failed.....
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.16,0:08:54.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We all die so quickly every time, isn't this a bit too hard?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.08,0:08:57.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you remember the transformation we saw yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.76,0:09:00.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's a level 60 ability, called "Wild Form"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:02.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It allows beasts to attain a human form
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.56,0:09:05.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Human players on the other hand can choose their Wild Shapes
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.80,0:09:08.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So yesterday we must have been killed by a level 60 player
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.80,0:09:12.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei held up for quite a bit, we were all level 1!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.64,0:09:15.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I belive we might be stronger than we think
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.12,0:09:16.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can try and test leveling up first
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.64,0:09:19.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Once we get a bigger picture, we can return to lvl 1 to accept this mission
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.00,0:09:21.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanna acept it right now
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.12,0:09:24.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since we already know the mission, we can't just have "test it out" as our attitude
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.52,0:09:29.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't die, we must complete the mission in on go
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.80,0:09:32.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,thinking there's always next time, is wrong to begin with
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:34.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.32,0:09:35.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.12,0:09:39.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,  In short, we can get killed, but Xiaohei must stay alive
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.48,0:09:42.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh...doesn't sound that right
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.96,0:09:43.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No one will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.96,0:09:44.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.84,0:09:47.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then let's set the goal, all of us must stay alive
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.56,0:09:48.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.68,0:09:50.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since we are going for it on our first try,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.24,0:09:52.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,then let's prepare ourselves starting with the character creation
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.32,0:09:56.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With the limited edition in hand, we have a lot of options
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.32,0:09:58.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's be careful with every step from now on
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.84,0:10:01.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The strongest one here is Xiaohei, we'll be relying on you in combat
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.04,0:10:04.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best to protect everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.44,0:10:07.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Combat and fighting, me and Xiaohei will handle it
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.76,0:10:09.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm, then I'll be the adviser
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.12,0:10:11.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I am......
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.24,0:10:12.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gaming Xiaobai! [TL note: also slang for Novice]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.88,0:10:17.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sprint abilities in the game is the same as real life, with 6 different categories
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.56,0:10:20.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Beside spirit powers, it also test physical fitness and reaction
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.12,0:10:21.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ooh~
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.96,0:10:24.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shanxin for example, have great decision making and reaction speed
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.96,0:10:27.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's due to the many games you've plated, have some good combat sense
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.84,0:10:29.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But the body might not be able to keep up
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.20,0:10:31.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can try a summoning conjurer
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.44,0:10:32.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You might be better suited for control
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.80,0:10:34.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are there any healing classes?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.88,0:10:37.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yup, part of the living spirits branch, mainly for support
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.04,0:10:40.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Em, I'll think about it, I'll decide once we get into the game
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.32,0:10:43.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's keep it simple for Xiaobai, pick one from protective spirits branch
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.84,0:10:45.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm-Alright
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.32,0:10:47.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Me and Xiaohei will stick with what we are good at
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.20,0:10:50.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hahaha, seems like the real deal!!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.16,0:10:55.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The current 4 tasks in the mission, the 2nd one seems impossible for now
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.36,0:10:56.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We won't be callenging it for now
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.92,0:10:58.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's prioritize the first taks
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.60,0:11:02.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The 3rd and 4th can be completed while we level up
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.00,0:11:04.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The focus here are the failure conditions
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.28,0:11:07.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Death leads to failure, that much is obvious
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.52,0:11:12.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Other than that. Task 2, 3 and 4 doesn't have any other losing conditions
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.44,0:11:13.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can complete them slowly
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.24,0:11:17.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mainly it's the 1st task, requiring no red-names
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.60,0:11:20.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means, if our names turn red, the mission is failed
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.04,0:11:22.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is quite dangerous
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.44,0:11:24.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because human characters spawns in their respective factions
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.84,0:11:28.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,for a realistic experience, there's no way for players to checck which faction others belong to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.76,0:11:32.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if they traverse to other territories they might encounter players from the same factions
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.64,0:11:34.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why there are so many red-named players
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.56,0:11:36.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.00,0:11:37.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have an idea
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.80,0:11:39.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We create our own faction!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.48,0:11:40.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.24,0:11:42.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We create our own faction
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.16,0:11:44.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,this way, everyone else will be an enemy faction
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.40,0:11:47.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As long as we don't kill each other, we won't be red-named
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.96,0:11:49.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's that easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.24,0:11:51.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not quite, there are requirements for creating a faction
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.64,0:11:55.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,1. Creating a faction takes at least 3 players
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.16,0:11:57.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,2. Acquiring a faction territory
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.92,0:12:00.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As soon as it's lost, the faction is disbanded
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.08,0:12:03.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Good thing that hijacking faction grounds is part of a side quest
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.56,0:12:05.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's something we'll have to go through
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.68,0:12:07.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How does hijacking work?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.52,0:12:09.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Destroy enemy faction leader! Replacint at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.88,0:12:12.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But faction members have a 4x power multiplier in their territory
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.12,0:12:13.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa......
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.12,0:12:16.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's already a world map made by some folks online
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.28,0:12:18.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These colors are player territories
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:20.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The greens are unclaimed wild grounds
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.08,0:12:23.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Places like these require defeating bosses that spaws there to become factions grounds
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.32,0:12:26.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Of course we know bosses are players as well
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.96,0:12:29.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So it's the same thing as hijacking another faction's territory
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.36,0:12:31.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But bosses have systematic buffs
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.16,0:12:33.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Normal players need to group up in large numbers to defeat them
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.08,0:12:38.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bosses are an unknown to us
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.76,0:12:40.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've heard some are ridiculously powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.52,0:12:42.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's try hijacking another territory instead
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.56,0:12:44.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we can confirm a target,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.00,0:12:45.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm quite adept at assasinations
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.80,0:12:46.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.60,0:12:47.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.68,0:12:48.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.60,0:12:51.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shanxin, you'll have to lay down to play~
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.32,0:13:16.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ugh, this episode is so boring
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.60,0:13:30.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa, seems like a desert this time
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.80,0:13:35.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei......
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.80,0:13:37.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did you hair turn black?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.16,0:13:38.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm, it lets you choose the colors
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.44,0:13:40.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh~~
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.68,0:13:41.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Tha'ts adorable
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.76,0:13:44.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hahahahaha~
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.08,0:13:48.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alright, seems like we've made our group
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.24,0:13:49.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's all accept this quest
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.44,0:13:55.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ok, this way the quest progression will auto-update
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.40,0:13:59.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right now our mission is to level up, then hijack a faction territory
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.84,0:14:01.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but have to make sure we don't get red-named
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.04,0:14:04.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's not deal with human players before forming a faction
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.60,0:14:07.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's stick with non-human players for now to level safely
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.68,0:14:08.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.20,0:14:12.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a lizard there
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.04,0:14:14.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do we get XP by killing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.56,0:14:21.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's not understimate any players
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.08,0:14:22.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mmmhm...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.43,0:14:22.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.28,0:14:24.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.68,0:14:27.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This place suddenly became private territory
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.72,0:14:30.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does that mean......someone defeated the boss that spawned here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.84,0:14:33.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Success!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.84,0:14:37.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa! You can see every player in our territory
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:40.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,ALRIGHT! Everyone split up, let's take them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.60,0:14:41.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,OOOH--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.64,0:14:43.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.96,0:14:44.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go for these
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.92,0:14:45.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,4 people
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.32,0:14:47.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, alright
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.96,0:14:49.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's test out the faction territory buffs!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.16,0:14:52.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,ONWARDS! HAHAHAHA
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.00,0:14:56.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will this game ever have something like a transport tool?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.40,0:14:58.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe in the future
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:03.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.76,0:15:06.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We should be out of here in 2 kilometers
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.92,0:15:08.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Running doesn't seem tiring in this game
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.44,0:15:14.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.16,0:15:16.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are all level 1s
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.48,0:15:17.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't really fell the buff like this
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.76,0:15:20.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then let's quickly clear 'em, and look for the next group
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.48,0:15:23.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiahei, can you take them?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.44,0:15:25.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't we kill other humans yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.00,0:15:28.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They must be a new faction, don't worry, it won't read-name ya
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.16,0:15:31.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you kill them, they won't actually die right
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.80,0:15:33.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They are all substitutes, their true forms are unscathed
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.68,0:15:36.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't we "die" a couple times before
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.40,0:15:37.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm, understood
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.08,0:15:43.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dant it! What's going on!?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.60,0:15:49.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa!!! Xiaohei is amazing!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.12,0:15:51.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, we've leveled up
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.08,0:15:54.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're at Lv 11!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.12,0:15:58.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means, the two we just defeated were Lv 28 or higher
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.04,0:16:02.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh! We've unlocked Level Vision
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:03.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wink with 1 eye
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.76,0:16:06.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can see our levels!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.80,0:16:08.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone's level 11
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.20,0:16:09.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That went quite smoothly
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.40,0:16:12.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I didn't think XIaohei was this much stronger than big bro
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.20,0:16:15.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My physical traits are sub par, can't control spirits that well either
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.40,0:16:19.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, how many of those enemies can you take?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.88,0:16:22.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As long they don't use anything unforseen, I can take all of them
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.28,0:16:24.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa......
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.84,0:16:26.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was Lv1 against Lv28
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.56,0:16:29.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've also leveled up mid-combat, aren't you invincible?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.88,0:16:32.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The quest doesn't seem so hard now
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.92,0:16:35.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ignoring level differences, attacking weak spots still cause death
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.72,0:16:37.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This setting is definitely good for Xiaohei
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.28,0:16:40.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But there are still many abilities we have to watch out for
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.84,0:16:42.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They were clearly caugh off guard
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.48,0:16:44.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's still be careful about it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.08,0:16:44.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mmmhm
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.12,0:16:47.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's distribute our attribute points
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:48.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.04,0:16:50.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the Spatial branch
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.84,0:16:52.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What else does XIaohei use?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.84,0:16:54.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mmmmm......
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.00,0:16:56.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Add some to Iron elements in the defense branch
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.76,0:16:57.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then click here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.40,0:17:00.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it like this...and this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.96,0:17:02.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yup, Xiaohei is qute smart!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.44,0:17:05.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't really read, not really smart......
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.48,0:17:06.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can teach you to read!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.64,0:17:07.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:10.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I'm scared that I might not learn......
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.04,0:17:11.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How come?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.48,0:17:14.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.96,0:17:15.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.60,0:17:16.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's run!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.32,0:17:18.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What! They were taken out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.56,0:17:20.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.60,0:17:23.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not good......there's too many
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:27.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even if Xiaohei can deal with them, some of us might die
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.20,0:17:29.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei! Look behind the group!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.80,0:17:33.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The last 4 people have the highest level, the faction leader must be one of 'em
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.00,0:17:35.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you can take them out,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.64,0:17:38.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll level up to uabout 20 and get the territorial buff
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.68,0:17:39.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alright
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.96,0:17:40.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I seem to be stronger than before
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.84,0:17:42.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Leave the rest to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.48,0:17:42.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.12,0:17:59.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Alright! The buff is ours!!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.20,0:18:02.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, they are invaders
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:17.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We are level 25
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.80,0:18:18.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa......
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.24,0:18:21.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seems like we have quite the early advantage
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.64,0:18:24.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They all have spiritual powers, but can't utilize it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.48,0:18:28.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,THe changes in gameplay, even a pro-gamer like me can't adapt that well
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.80,0:18:30.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I don't think It'll take long,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.28,0:18:32.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,before many becomes comfortable with this game
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.72,0:18:39.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sure this is a human?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.96,0:18:42.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm, already confirmed with them
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.12,0:18:45.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Interesting, this game is quite fun indeed
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.04,0:18:47.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You sure you wanna kill kim?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.12,0:18:47.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm, let's go
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.00,0:18:56.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Speaking of, what abilities did Xiaobai pick?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.44,0:18:57.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire~~
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.28,0:18:58.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh? that's unexpected
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.40,0:19:01.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire is quite hard to control, why did you pick fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.72,0:19:02.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because......
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.80,0:19:03.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,COOL!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.64,0:19:09.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But why can't I make even sparks, even though we are level 25......
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.88,0:19:11.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's not tutorial either
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.00,0:19:14.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is due to your control of Spiritual Power
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.08,0:19:16.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,despite its difficulty being lower than the real world
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.64,0:19:18.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,let me teach ya how to use it
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.68,0:19:22.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about you big bro, you are also Level 25, how'ts it compared to before?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.12,0:19:27.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Whoa~~
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.12,0:19:28.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think we might just be invincible
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.44,0:19:31.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now we have our own faction territory
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.80,0:19:33.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Most players choose to grind levels in their own territory
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.96,0:19:36.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but we of course must leave
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.48,0:19:39.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To deal with players who leaves immediately after esablishing a faction
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.40,0:19:43.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,After others who enter this territory can receive quests to hunt down faction leaders
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.00,0:19:46.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They'll receive their location on the map
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.92,0:19:48.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then let me be the faction leader,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.68,0:19:50.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,no need for Xiaohei to take that role, or else he'll be followed
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.80,0:19:52.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.04,0:19:54.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This kind of quest can only be taken by humans
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.44,0:19:58.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So any human that approach us could be suspicious
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.92,0:20:00.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Understood
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.48,0:20:06.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are there really 10s of millions of players playing
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.00,0:20:09.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fells like there aren't many players around
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.76,0:20:11.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't we spawn into a populated central area last time
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.24,0:20:14.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It might distribute players based on territory
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.96,0:20:17.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The only permanent stat in this game is Map Progression
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.20,0:20:20.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spawn points are auomatically unlocked
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.24,0:20:22.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Every respawn will be at different locations,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.56,0:20:24.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but take look at our progression percentage
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.00,0:20:26.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Holy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.88,0:20:28.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though this is a gmae from Elfins,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.96,0:20:30.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but how did they make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.04,0:20:32.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This might be someone's Spirit Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.95,0:20:33.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.93,0:20:34.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mhm
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.28,0:20:37.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This body might be a replica, but it also really exists
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.20,0:20:38.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.52,0:20:41.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.72,0:20:53.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are all of them players?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.76,0:20:56.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Won't they fight one another?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.68,0:20:58.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe wolves are set to be unable to kill its own kind
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.56,0:21:01.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What were you saying about no players?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.04,0:21:02.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's not complain for now......
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.60,0:21:06.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,AAAAWOOOOOO~~
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.56,0:21:08.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do we fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.16,0:21:09.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't take that many
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.15,0:21:11.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do we run?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.48,0:21:12.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't outrun 4 legs
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.32,0:21:14.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,THEN WHAT DO WE DO!!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.80,0:21:16.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei run aay quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.64,0:21:17.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,DON'T GIVE UP SO EASILY!!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.80,0:21:42.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is quite fun
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.32,0:21:45.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This game's only been online for 3 days
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.76,0:21:47.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How many humans like these do you think are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.40,0:21:50.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to it
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.27,0:22:02.65,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette\NStay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.65,0:22:07.39,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo \NOur destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.39,0:22:12.09,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni\NBut with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.09,0:22:18.29,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,kore kara deau kimi e to\NI’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.29,0:22:24.44,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete\NWait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.44,0:22:29.24,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo\NEven if our first “hello” is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.24,0:22:33.92,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara\NWhen we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.92,0:22:40.44,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou\NLet’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.44,0:22:51.76,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga\NThe days when we can casually say “See you tomorrow”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.76,0:22:57.18,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite\NAre so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.18,0:23:02.22,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai\NThose feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.22,0:23:13.45,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo\NWe can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.45,0:23:19.00,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete kitto boku wo yonderu\NBut they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.00,0:23:25.84,Ending Song,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu\N And surely, they’re calling out to me
